Next: Alembic

Now we'll introduce Alembic for database migrations.

The workflow we'll use is:

SQLAlchemy Model
       ↓
   Alembic
       ↓
Migration File
       ↓
   PostgreSQL
       ↓
    Table

For example, when we create:

class Movie(Base):
    ...

we won't manually execute:

CREATE TABLE movies ...

Instead:

Model change
    ↓
alembic revision --autogenerate
    ↓
Migration generated
    ↓
alembic upgrade head
    ↓
PostgreSQL updated

That's the workflow.

